  "title": "Procurement Policy Note 05/19: Tackling Modern Slavery in Government Supply Chains",
  "canonical_url": "https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/procurement-policy-note-0519-tackling-modern-slavery-in-government-supply-chains",
  "description": "This guidance sets out how UK Government departments must take action to ensure modern slavery risks are identified and managed in government supply chains.\r\n",
